{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Shelter — the door that won't open\n🚪 Contains its own Dark World (confirmed in Ch.3). Lock with 3 codes: pine, police badge, and Delta Rune.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Shelter.png","x":-75,"y":-425,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Undyne**\nKidnapped by the Knight at the end of Ch.3. Her Darkner form (armor + cyan skin) is the only visual proof of the Shelter's Dark World.","x":-150,"y":-925,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Undyne_Dark_World_Sprite.webp","x":-95,"y":-1315,"width":190,"height":152},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Roaring Knight**\nGoes in and out of the Shelter without a code. Responsible for both captures: Undyne (Ch.3) and Asgore (Ch.5).","x":332,"y":-768,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Knight_screenshot_Undyne_captured.png","x":628,"y":-1080,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Asgore**\nKnows and hides the police badge code, 0915199X, from having been police chief. Captured at the end of Ch.5.","x":630,"y":-358,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/flowery_shelter_code_scene.webp","x":1075,"y":-465,"width":190,"height":157},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Dess**\nThe pine code, 122(5), is hidden in her guitar. Several clues point to this being where the incident that made her disappear took place.","x":630,"y":148,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/dess_guitar.png","x":1075,"y":295,"width":165,"height":170},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Carol**\nHas been investigating the area since Ch.3; by Ch.5 she's already actively \"handling things\" inside the Shelter itself.","x":332,"y":558,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Carol_Holiday.webp","x":628,"y":910,"width":78,"height":170},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**Alphys**\nConfirms in dialogue that she's only seen Undyne and the mayor head that way.","x":-150,"y":715,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Alvin**\nWhen asked about the Shelter, he tells Kris to drop the subject and stay away.","x":-632,"y":558,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**🎲 Gaster**\nThe mus_smile sound at 15% next to the door is the same one from Undertale's Entry Number 17 — a real musical clue, without textual confirmation.","x":-930,"y":148,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s8","type":"text","text":"**🎲 The number 1225**\nDess's code reappears in several puzzles tied to Noelle — a possible deliberate numeric motif for the Holiday family.","x":-930,"y":-358,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s9","type":"text","text":"**🎲 \"Depths\" and \"Hell\"**\nThe team's Thank You survey responded the same way to Shelter, Depths, and Hell — a datamine finding, not confirmed in the game.","x":-632,"y":-768,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1"}],"edges":[{"id":"e_center-img","fromNode":"center-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"center","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s3-img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s4","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s6","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e_s7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s7","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s8","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s8","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s9","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s9","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_undyne_knight","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_asgore_knight","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s1","toSide":"bottom","color":"4"},{"id":"cross_asgore_dess_codes","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_dess_1225","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s8","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_carol_alphys","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s5","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_alvin_gaster","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_gaster_depths","fromNode":"s7","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s9","toSide":"left","color":"1"}]}